  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Disability Movements in the Indo-Pacific (2024-25)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment continues a partnership with the Disability Rights Advocacy Fund (DRAF) to strengthen and support the critical work of Organisations of People with Disabilities (OPDs) in the Indo-Pacific. It includes grants and capacity building support to OPDs to support a stronger and more diverse disability rights movement.</narrative>
  </description>
